    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon tonyarau Moses, kirwor neni keŋ aloeema a ŋolo elipere tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tolimok Ŋisirael ebe, ‘Ani eyauni idio kus ainakinet alobaren keŋ neni ke Ekapolon, emaikina tolemu alosipan a ŋaatuk keŋ, kori a ŋakinei keŋ.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kerae ainakinet ŋin ŋina epeyo ŋina elemunitae alosipan a ŋibaren, emaikina iŋes tolemu etaok ŋolo ajokan ŋolo emam neni eŋwalit; yau lopuke ŋolo ke eema a ŋolo ilipere, ikotere Ekapolon ecamuni aŋuna keŋ ibarasit ŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ituŋanan ŋin kidokok akan keŋ nakou ka ainakinet a ŋina epeyo a ŋin, ikotere Ekapolon ecamuni ainakinet ŋin tomookunere iŋes asecit keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ituŋanan ŋin toar ibarasit ŋin a nen, tosodo nai ŋidwe ka Aron ŋulusapa ŋulu erae ŋisacaradotin tolemut ŋaokot, yaasi kipakakis lowaetin daadaŋ anamuroet a ŋina eyai lopuke ŋolo elomarere loeema ŋolo ilipere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ituŋanan ŋin toyeŋ ainakinet ŋin ŋina epeyo, ido kileny ibarasit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ŋidwe ka Aron ŋulusapa ŋulu erae ŋisacaradotin kinokakis akim kidiama namuroet, kinapinapakis ŋakito nakim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina nai ŋidwe ka Aron ŋulusapa ŋulu erae ŋisacaradotin tolemununut ŋakir kinapanakis, tolemut akou ka asepwae daŋ kiwuakis nakito ŋuna enepete alokidiama namuroet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai emaikina ŋini elemunit ainakinet ŋin, kilota ŋiboro ka akook a ibarasit kaapei ka ŋimolokony; ido emaikina esacaradoti kicuny ibore ŋin daadaŋ alokidiama amuroet, anerae erae iŋes ainakinet ŋina epeyo, ŋina ebob eure keŋ aneni ke Ekapolon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kerae ainakinet ŋin ŋina epeyo ŋina elemunitae alosipan a ŋakinei, a ŋamesekin, kori a ŋamee, emaikina tolemunae ibarasit ŋinimoŋ ŋini ajokan ŋini emam neni eŋwalit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ibarasit ŋin toarae alo Kuju namuroet alokiŋaren Ekapolon, tosodo nai ŋidwe ka Aron ŋulusapa ŋulu erae ŋisacaradotin, tolemut ŋaokot, kipakakis lowaetin daadaŋ anamuroet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ibarasit ŋin kilenyae, tolemunae akou ka asepwae, ido kinapanak esacaradoti akiriŋ ŋin nakito ŋuna enepete alokidiama namuroet; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nai ŋiboro ka akook a ibarasit kaapei ka ŋimolokony, emaikina kilotarae; ido emaikina esacaradoti kicuny ibore ŋin daadaŋ alokidiama namuroet, anerae erae iŋes ainakinet ŋina epeyo, ŋina emaikina ebob eure keŋ aneni ke Ekapolon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kerae ainakinet kon ŋina epeyo ŋin neni ke Ekapolon ŋin ikenyit, emaikina iyoŋ toseu ainakinet kon ŋin erae akuri, kori temeleudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina esacaradoti yau ikeny ŋin namuroet, tomojir akou totubo, ido kicuny anamuroet; ido emaikina ŋaokot a ikenyit a ŋin kitiitakinae epeiwae namuroet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ituŋanan ŋini eyaunit ainakinet ŋin tolema aŋalube nyepunoro, kimasak lowae ŋolo alo Kide namuroet, nakibois ŋina emudio ekuron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ituŋanan ŋin totero ŋabebenuk a ikenyit a ŋin, ido kibel alokuyoit, nai nyetubo ŋabebenuk. Emaikina nai esacaradoti kicuny ikenyit ŋin alokidiama namuroet, anerae erae iŋes ainakinet ŋina epeyo, ŋina ebob eure keŋ aneni ke Ekapolon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
